<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: shipcracker warcasket -->
  <SCWC_Warcasket_Shipcracker.label>破艦型戰棺裝甲</SCWC_Warcasket_Shipcracker.label>

  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket shell with improved impact dispersion, equipped with drop thrusters for breaching jumps and a ranged shield. -->
  <SCWC_Warcasket_Shipcracker.shortDescription>特化型太空科技戰棺外殼，強化了衝擊分散性能。配備空降推進器，可進行破壁跳躍，另有一具阻擋遠程攻擊的護盾。</SCWC_Warcasket_Shipcracker.shortDescription>

  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket shell with improved impact dispersion, equipped with drop thrusters for breaching jumps and a ranged shield.\n\n10th generation warcaskets were actually adapted from captured pirate rigs, with government military research divisions improving them with advanced power armor designs. Access to a greater amount of high quality resources and the objective of equipping them onto combat veterans that would otherwise be unable to serve meant the program created single-user operated dreadnoughts. The versatility of the armors have been improved, generally reducing restrictions on mixing pieces of different armor series even across generations.\n\nThe Shipcracker series is an Imperial boarding pattern rather than a pirate one, built to cross the gap between two ships and open the far hull from the outside. Its drop thrusters throw the pilot across the vacuum onto the enemy hull, and the landing punches through into the interior. Under gravity the same burn clears a wall or a roof in a single hop. Because the shield only stops ranged attacks, this series is suited to pilots who prefer close work and expect to take a ship room by room. Salvage and desertion have since put the pattern in foundries far from any Imperial dock. -->
  <SCWC_Warcasket_Shipcracker.description>特化型太空科技戰棺外殼，強化了衝擊分散性能。配備空降推進器，可進行破壁跳躍，另有一具阻擋遠程攻擊的護盾。\n\n第十代戰棺有些特殊，它們是用從海盜那裡收繳的設備改造而成的。然而，軍備的更新迭代顯然絕非易事。為了盡早將新型戰棺投入實戰，政府的軍備研發部不惜斥下巨資，並用上了最高級的動力裝甲技術。與前幾代相比，第十代的整體性能不僅獲得了全方位提升，不同型號部件間的相容性也得到了大幅改進，跨代進行組裝完全不成問題。藉助它們的力量，許多不甘於因負傷殘疾就早早退役的老兵們也得以迅速重返戰場。在許多人心中，只有第十代才是最配得上「戰棺」這個響亮名號的。\n\n破艦型系列是帝國的登船設計，不是海盜的。它的用途是跨越兩艦之間的空隙，從外側破開敵艦的船體。空降推進器將駕駛員拋過真空，落在敵艦的船體上，著陸時直接撞穿，進入艦內。到了有重力的地方，同樣的推進力只需一躍，就能越過一道牆或一片屋頂。由於護盾只擋得住遠程攻擊，這個系列適合愛打近身戰、準備逐間拿下整艘船的駕駛員。此後經由打撈與叛逃，這款設計流落到遠離帝國船塢的各地鑄造廠。</SCWC_Warcasket_Shipcracker.description>

  <!-- EN: shipcracker warcasket shoulders -->
  <SCWC_WarcasketShoulders_Shipcracker.label>破艦型戰棺護肩</SCWC_WarcasketShoulders_Shipcracker.label>

  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket pauldrons with improved impact dispersion, equipped with melee assistor modules and hardened breaching arms that let a landing tear through plasteel. -->
  <SCWC_WarcasketShoulders_Shipcracker.shortDescription>特化型太空科技戰棺護肩，強化了衝擊分散性能。配備近戰輔助模組，以及足以讓著陸衝擊撕開塑鋼的硬化破壁臂。</SCWC_WarcasketShoulders_Shipcracker.shortDescription>

